{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-semver/python-semver/compare/4e09ef0e4c94314731f960d4ce763a2da2e096f1...3d4421326bcd2511c9773d4ebbefe4a9a5c5f521", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-semver/python-semver/compare/4e09ef0e4c94314731f960d4ce763a2da2e096f1...3d4421326bcd2511c9773d4ebbefe4a9a5c5f521", "permalink_url": "https://github.com/python-semver/python-semver/compare/python-semver:4e09ef0...python-semver:3d44213", "diff_url": "https://github.com/python-semver/python-semver/compare/4e09ef0e4c94314731f960d4ce763a2da2e096f1...3d4421326bcd2511c9773d4ebbefe4a9a5c5f521.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/python-semver/python-semver/compare/4e09ef0e4c94314731f960d4ce763a2da2e096f1...3d4421326bcd2511c9773d4ebbefe4a9a5c5f521.patch", "base_commit": {"sha": "4e09ef0e4c94314731f960d4ce763a2da2e096f1", "node_id": "C_kwDOADOCbtoAKDRlMDllZjBlNGM5NDMxNDczMWY5NjBkNGNlNzYzYTJkYTJlMDk2ZjE", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Vincent Gao", "email": "gaobing1230@gmail.com", "date": "2026-07-15T10:24:39Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-07-15T10:24:39Z"}, "message": "fix: next_version should bump version for build-only versions (#469)\n\nnext_version('patch') on a version with build metadata but no prerelease\n(e.g. 1.2.3+build.5) would strip the build and return the same version\n(1.2.3) instead of bumping the patch (1.2.4).\n\nThe condition in next_version was (version.prerelease or version.build),\nwhich caused build-only versions to enter the 'finalization' path meant\nfor prereleases. Build metadata does not affect version precedence, so\nits presence should not trigger version finalization.\n\nChange the condition to only check version.prerelease.\n\n* docs: update next_version build-only example for new bump behavior", "tree": {"sha": "bd0ea7c29711e18d879750c986e672551bc0ad4c", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-semver/python-semver/git/trees/bd0ea7c29711e18d879750c986e672551bc0ad4c"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-semver/python-semver/git/commits/4e09ef0e4c94314731f960d4ce763a2da2e096f1", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV1/nCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM60QAGVOsbnlsz8XhuQMaaL4eqo3\nPsOk6xn27Lf7oV12DTwCmheP3T/okB2gkCYw0eVX5HsSTXm0bDsMKGOQyay59Iq0\n/swtsbbbSmgRhhz76gP7GUQjUZ0AFWH1iFVGGGmoQ2qLfa7rFxBeknh0jElzfiNX\n92wGTBWboUxtTf6O4AwYjNnwtzpRFxgnCP1PeJigzazdPKhNU70zJznvns4p0j21\n7omByRyrfFS8z8mOBkZ7V35DNeZ0uoZUMQtW9uyVOmB9sTWyJN0eUF2jMBfFnchO\nVh5ArvqI4OyMsXz4sAl+pfRbwkVAjQbUqm7lQdbIs3+ilWm+kTDjtTI/KfEkceZ6\nQOLkyjpMYQSTnKkerN3mVQ0XAw2jXog82w918a5PBeRZBrQB6h9D178mAJbXJhhE\n8Kqizvno7mAj9c0qsFEdqX9HaQOW63CL93p99YNxQ1z1VmCe4xgIHa14eA2LxcjF\nfEDF1iGOixTUXH1dTPOM7z7jx241LKSzXXS/v0u+2VtUpLbBaIWgR79CwwDIdPFq\n0iymkgyqiZPSCYDAfVKq2oYzeroIuP6LK4GKWD8MjwXh4eahiprzNCVCbjYp0tpb\neZHgVLTkWY/TeruHOkL+WsbFdngZuKA3jWpDqjJc3zAqzik65pC8FMTaP+LbkcgH\noxgBkVLU8q9MwGvBY9DM\n=RhNI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree bd0ea7c29711e18d879750c986e672551bc0ad4c\nparent a8bb4f89fc010b367d0925dc4da72c883d2d15d3\nauthor Vincent Gao <gaobing1230@gmail.com> 1784111079 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784111079 +0200\n\nfix: next_version should bump version for build-only versions (#469)\n\nnext_version('patch') on a version with build metadata but no prerelease\n(e.g. 1.2.3+build.5) would strip the build and return the same version\n(1.2.3) instead of bumping the patch (1.2.4).\n\nThe condition in next_version was (version.prerelease or version.build),\nwhich caused build-only versions to enter the 'finalization' path meant\nfor prereleases. Build metadata does not affect version precedence, so\nits presence should not trigger version finalization.\n\nChange the condition to only check version.prerelease.\n\n* docs: update next_version build-only example for new bump behavior", "verified_at": "2026-07-15T10:24:40Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-semver/pyth